  nonce: 98c0  # 98c0
  message: "Fixed in PR #2089. gitleaks.py _scan returns None on any non-zero exit (with --exit-code 0, findings never exit non-zero), so an unloadable config is a failed scan, never cached clean. Live repro against the real binary: GITLEAKS_CONFIG pointing at a missing file -> scan returned None and no cache file was written; with a valid config the same input reported aws-access-token. Production-path test: test_gitleaks.py real-binary test with a missing GITLEAKS_CONFIG."  # 98c0
